Building our Master Gene List
========================================================
Inputs: 
	Combined Stats file with FST, TD difference, and Composite Score
	Gene ID and Coordinate file

1. Encode BP-positions for each stat in intervals and label the top windows
2. Buffer gene intervals by 1kb to account for regulatory regions
3. Bedtools intersect these files together on the interval start/stop columns. 
4. Perform groub-by operations to get average stats per gene. Also encode in this file whether any special windows are present in the gene
5. Incorporate David's WNV-VIP list

This gives us a MASTER GENELIST File that can be used for both Analysis 1 (GO-based) and Analysis 2 (Stat ranking w/GSEA?)

MASTER GENELIST
chrom	start	stop	gene	fst	tajima	comp_score	top_0.1	top_1	vip
